   "body": "## Summary\n\nV0 §16 ordered flow: **Preview → Apply summary → new Draft Version → editor**. Merchant app only; no PHP, endpoint, schema or Publish-rule change; `PRESENTATION_CONFIG_VERSION` stays 3; no accounting effect.\n\n- **Preview in the builder** (`/commerce/appearance?version=<base>&previewTheme=<id>`): the Canvas renders `applyTheme(base, theme)` over the merchant's own data with the real device switch. Read-only: editing rails inert, Save/Publish disabled, nothing written.\n- **Apply summary** (ten areas + fixed \"what stays\" list) from the V10a core; an identical theme disables Apply.\n- **The one write:** create a NEW Draft Version → save the themed copy with that draft's revision → on failure delete the new draft and report. Published Version and existing Versions are never written.\n- **Theme Gallery** now renders the six built-in themes; action is *Preview & apply* (the one-click apply and the parallel `theme-registry.ts` are removed — one source of truth). Bloom's gift pack unchanged (FLOWERS-H15).\n- Assets still fail closed (clone-on-apply remains deferred).\n\n## Verification\n\n- Web: store-experience-builder + commerce-workspace + themes/appearance pages: 2652 tests passed.\n- Real Chromium `flowers-h15-bloom-theme.spec.ts` (9): gallery at 390/1440 AR + 1440 EN; gallery → Preview → summary → Apply writes the themed draft (preview wrote nothing first); preview bar at 390/768/1024/1440 AR RTL + EN LTR without overflow.\n- Report: `docs/plans/store/CUST-HV-V10B-IMPLEMENTATION-REPORT.md`.\n\nMerge: squash under the CUST-HV sequential-merge authorization once CI is green. Deploy: NOT PERFORMED. Production release: NOT PERFORMED.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01X45qjD8TFC1aANFxVZSvb2\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01X45qjD8TFC1aANFxVZSvb2)_",
